(7760474, 1285107, 42733, '<td valign="top">My kind of mess! :)</td>', 'My kind of mess! :)', '2023-11-28 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760487, 1285233, 6804, '<td valign="top">I like this rendition of YOUR space. The lighting is warm and natural. The image is real, and not contrived to fit the challenge. I can see you struggled to get the image square to the frame. I had the same challenge. The image I see through the view-finder is not exactly the same as the lens is actually shooting.  (And we can''t crop it to make it even). Anyone who hasn''t actually tried to shoot for the minimal editing challenge simply couldn''t appreciate the off-center crop, or the burst of light showing on only a few books in the row.  I hope your entry does well in the challenge.  Great job!, High marks from me.</td>', 'I like this rendition of YOUR space. The lighting is warm and natural. The image is real, and not contrived to fit the challenge. I can see you struggled to get the image square to the frame. I had the same challenge. The image I see through the view-finder is not exactly the same as the lens is actually shooting.  (And we can''t crop it to make it even). Anyone who hasn''t actually tried to shoot for the minimal editing challenge simply couldn''t appreciate the off-center crop, or the burst of light showing on only a few books in the row.  I hope your entry does well in the challenge.  Great job!, High marks from me.', '2023-11-28 23:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760488, 1285284, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool image, by itself.  As far as meeting the challenge.. I''m having a hard time seeing how this become''s YOUR space. The title "Litter" ..... I don''t see any litter.  You''ve done a great job with the minimal edditing here, but I just can''t rate this awesome image as high as some of the other images that had a much more direct way of defining the "your Space" part of the challenge. I do hope this is helpful and I hope the shot does well in the challenge. Good luck with it!</td>', 'This is a pretty cool image, by itself.  As far as meeting the challenge.. I''m having a hard time seeing how this become''s YOUR space. The title "Litter" ..... I don''t see any litter.  You''ve done a great job with the minimal edditing here, but I just can''t rate this awesome image as high as some of the other images that had a much more direct way of defining the "your Space" part of the challenge. I do hope this is helpful and I hope the shot does well in the challenge. Good luck with it!', '2023-11-28 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
