(7760595, 1285314, 8759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi Tibi!  How did you get the phone up there?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have a pull up bar in the room. I used a clamp and a selfie stick I have for my motorcycle and used the wide angle with the S-pen of the phone as a remote control.</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Hi Tibi!  How did you get the phone up there??   I have a pull up bar in the room. I used a clamp and a selfie stick I have for my motorcycle and used the wide angle with the S-pen of the phone as a remote control.', '2023-12-01 19:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7760599, 1285189, 68504, '<td valign="top">I didn''t enter this challenge because it would have been too revealing.  This is the only entry I can identify with. For a long time our dining room table served as a temporary project of whatever kind work space. Temporary is a long long word.  And I put things there simply to compete, to lay claim to some space. Internecine warfare.</td>', 'I didn''t enter this challenge because it would have been too revealing.  This is the only entry I can identify with. For a long time our dining room table served as a temporary project of whatever kind work space. Temporary is a long long word.  And I put things there simply to compete, to lay claim to some space. Internecine warfare.', '2023-12-02 00:25:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7760707, 1285314, 30982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiberius:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi Tibi!  How did you get the phone up there?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have a pull up bar in the room. I used a clamp and a selfie stick I have for my motorcycle and used the wide angle with the S-pen of the phone as a remote control. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ah, very good!  Mine is the lesser S22 so I don''t have the pen/remote option.  I am always in awe of the ways you find to work your magic with your phone!</td>', 'Originally posted by Tiberius: Originally posted by Melethia: Hi Tibi!  How did you get the phone up there??   I have a pull up bar in the room. I used a clamp and a selfie stick I have for my motorcycle and used the wide angle with the S-pen of the phone as a remote control.  Ah, very good!  Mine is the lesser S22 so I don''t have the pen/remote option.  I am always in awe of the ways you find to work your magic with your phone!', '2023-12-04 19:08:58.000000', NULL, 0);
